    "lga_id_scope_note": "The source's lga_id is scoped to the LGA name, not to the state: each entry above carries one id in two states. Where both sides have many rows and distinct median points they are homonymous LGAs that genuinely exist in both states; where one side has a single row it is a mislabelled row (all such rows in the pinned source also lack coordinates and are quarantined on that ground). Consequence for every consumer: (state, city_area) is the unambiguous LGA key in this artifact; source_record.lga_id alone is not.",
